<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Your blood drive is coming up, and every
donation is vital because hospital patients are counting on lifesaving blood
products from your drive. We are grateful for your kindness and commitment to
helping those in need.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Diabetes impacts over 38 million people in the
United States, and nearly one-quarter do not know they have it.&nbsp;The
hemoglobin A1C test is commonly used to screen for prediabetes and diabetes,
both serious but treatable conditions. We know you care about helping patients
in need. We want you and your donors to know how much we care about them by
expanding our health offerings to include free A1C testing for all who
successfully give blood at your March blood drive.^ We’re also showing our
thanks with a $10 Amazon.com Gift Card** by email when donors come to give
March 1-31.*</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal"><b>Share the attached email</b>&nbsp;about these exciting incentives to recruit more blood donors!</li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule
     them using the Blood Drive Management Portal.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>IMPORTANT: Donors MUST have a valid email address on file
to receive their Gift Card. <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">All the best,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="noSpacingAbove spacingBelow" data-text-type="withSpacing" style="font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.6em; margin-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="nospacingabove" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:
.1in;margin-left:0in;background:white"><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-fareast;color:#323130">^The
American Red Cross will offer hemoglobin A1C (A1C) testing, commonly used to
screen for prediabetes and diabetes, to all donors who successfully give blood,
