color:#323130">or a&nbsp;</span></span><span style="color:black;mso-color-alt:
windowtext"><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https://www.redcrossblood.org/account-login.html&amp;data=05%7c02%7ckimberly.walter%40redcross.org%7cedf43d93fec846fdc2fc08dd25c69d92%7cdd5b5d42c0d34ad2b5f160edb3af2771%7c0%7c0%7c638708257157865314%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7c0%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=d0rxyY1ASobI1UFt1KizYlmaEvu1KPf6vvpcuxtZsYU%3D&amp;reserved=0"><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-fareast;
color:#A4262C">donor’s account</span></span></a></span><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-fareast;
color:#323130">&nbsp;at RedCrossBlood.org. If a donor does not wish to have
their donation tested for A1C, they are encouraged to make an appointment
before or after testing will be offered in March. </span></span><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
