&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-fareast">RedCrossBlood.org/diabetes</span></a></span><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
